{"4427720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pigs On Wings", "steam_appid": 4427720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pigs on  Wings</strong> is a hardcore cooperative flight sim with extraction mechanics. Set in an open world where medieval life is being upended by mysterious new forces, you must join the crew of a makeshift aircraft, defy the occupiers, and try to make it home alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk and Reward:</strong> Every sortie is a one-way ticket unless you make it back to base. Fight, complete missions, and scavenge for precious resources and blueprints in occupied lands. But beware: if you lose control or get shot down, your hard-earned loot will be buried under the wreckage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/e4e8aadece14191b9cf80a2e86771aeb.poster.avif?t=1787953634\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/e4e8aadece14191b9cf80a2e86771aeb.webm?t=1787953634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/e4e8aadece14191b9cf80a2e86771aeb.mp4?t=1787953634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Plane is Your Fortress:</strong> Repair the engine and patch up the wings mid-flight. Keep a constant eye on your fuel to reach the base, or make a gut-wrenching decision to crash-land and save what you can. Upgrade and modify your craft, transforming a &quot;flying crate&quot; into the terror of the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/704849884d9cd25ce1d6b3a05e8ddbcf.poster.avif?t=1787953634\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/704849884d9cd25ce1d6b3a05e8ddbcf.webm?t=1787953634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/704849884d9cd25ce1d6b3a05e8ddbcf.mp4?t=1787953634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Camraderie:</strong> You’re not just a pilot; you’re part of a crew. While one mans the controls, another monitors the engine, and a third fends off attackers. Coordinate, communicate, and be ready for the engine to stall or the gunner to run dry at the worst possible moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/9feff3abe1b386414c1fa399201debca.poster.avif?t=1787953634\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/9feff3abe1b386414c1fa399201debca.webm?t=1787953634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/9feff3abe1b386414c1fa399201debca.mp4?t=1787953634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Secrets:</strong> Explore an open world held by an unknown army. The enemy is rapidly evolving their air defenses—don't be surprised if you face something... inhuman alongside bows and catapults. Who is behind this war? What strange magic powers their machines?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/79e4ebdb951a0248586e5241e52e9349.avif?t=1787953634\" width=780 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom of Flight:</strong> From the moment you take off, the world is yours to explore. Take on peaceful errands for local farmers, deliver cargo, or engage in high-stakes assaults on fortified bastions. You define the difficulty of your own adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/3f021ca87655b4187d6c71b54c19db19.avif?t=1787953634\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression is Key:</strong> Master the invaders' technology, unlock new parts and aircraft upgrades, and expand your airbase infrastructure. Remember: every success in the sky is built on the tireless work of your ground engineers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you spread your wings where others have fallen?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pigs on  Wings</strong> is a hardcore cooperative flight sim with extraction mechanics. Set in an open world where medieval life is being upended by mysterious new forces, you must join the crew of a makeshift aircraft, defy the occupiers, and try to make it home alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk and Reward:</strong> Every sortie is a one-way ticket unless you make it back to base. Fight, complete missions, and scavenge for precious resources and blueprints in occupied lands. But beware: if you lose control or get shot down, your hard-earned loot will be buried under the wreckage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/e4e8aadece14191b9cf80a2e86771aeb.poster.avif?t=1787953634\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/e4e8aadece14191b9cf80a2e86771aeb.webm?t=1787953634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/e4e8aadece14191b9cf80a2e86771aeb.mp4?t=1787953634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Plane is Your Fortress:</strong> Repair the engine and patch up the wings mid-flight. Keep a constant eye on your fuel to reach the base, or make a gut-wrenching decision to crash-land and save what you can. Upgrade and modify your craft, transforming a &quot;flying crate&quot; into the terror of the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/704849884d9cd25ce1d6b3a05e8ddbcf.poster.avif?t=1787953634\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/704849884d9cd25ce1d6b3a05e8ddbcf.webm?t=1787953634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/704849884d9cd25ce1d6b3a05e8ddbcf.mp4?t=1787953634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Camraderie:</strong> You’re not just a pilot; you’re part of a crew. While one mans the controls, another monitors the engine, and a third fends off attackers. Coordinate, communicate, and be ready for the engine to stall or the gunner to run dry at the worst possible moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/9feff3abe1b386414c1fa399201debca.poster.avif?t=1787953634\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/9feff3abe1b386414c1fa399201debca.webm?t=1787953634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/9feff3abe1b386414c1fa399201debca.mp4?t=1787953634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Secrets:</strong> Explore an open world held by an unknown army. The enemy is rapidly evolving their air defenses—don't be surprised if you face something... inhuman alongside bows and catapults. Who is behind this war? What strange magic powers their machines?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4427720/extras/79e4ebdb951a0248586e5241e52e9349.avif?t=1787953634\" width=780 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom of Flight:</strong> From the moment you take off, the world is yours to explore. Take on peaceful errands for local farmers, deliver cargo, or engage in high-stakes assaults on fortified bastions. You define the difficulty of your own adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"